  m_text: 'This demo showcases a fast paced demo making use of the jump, dash and
    wall jump features. It also shows how to create a custom feature with the AutoMoveFeature,
    implementing the ICharacterFeature interface.


    How to Play:

    The player
    moves automatically.

    Jump, dash and wall jump to avoid the spikes.







    Press
    any key to start the game.'
